    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυμφᾰγωγ-έω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νενυμφαγώγηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					25.4.10
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>lead the bride to the bridegroom's house,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τινί τινα</span> Plb.l.c. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τῶν πολιτῶν θυγατέρας οἱ τύραννοι
