				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					11.41
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμους ν.</span>
			<i>premote</i> a marriage, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of the
			bridegroom, <i>lead home</i> a bride, <i><span class="en">
				Charito
				2.1
			</span></i>.</div>
